<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 21:34:16 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>司法部正在诉诸古老的法律来扣押伊朗油轮。美国已经很久没有使用它了，“我们必须举行降神会”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/justice-department-maritime-prize-law-centuries-old-iranian-oil-tankers/</link><description>司法部正在恢复奖励法，这是一套具有数百年历史的规则，可以简化扣押敌方船只的过程。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2269572147-e1787946894609.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 21:10:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/justice-department-maritime-prize-law-centuries-old-iranian-oil-tankers/</guid></item><item><title>Meta 的 170 亿美元青少年安全和解协议实际上是 1% 的税，而且是 TikTok 和 YouTube 中的一个游戏</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/metas-17-billion-teen-safety-settlement-is-really-a-1-tax-and-a-play-to-box-in-tiktok-and-youtube/</link><description>更深层次的教训是，产品设计作为法律责任的场所，是一种可行的法律策略。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2281617231-e1787951229149.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 21:08:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/metas-17-billion-teen-safety-settlement-is-really-a-1-tax-and-a-play-to-box-in-tiktok-and-youtube/</guid></item><item><title>多莉·帕顿 (Dolly Parton) 很可能在同一天写下了她最热门的两首歌曲</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/dolly-parton-three-greatest-songs-jolene-love-you-9-to-5/</link><description>三首歌比其他任何歌曲都更能体现多莉·帕顿的天才。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-57000913.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 20:58:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/dolly-parton-three-greatest-songs-jolene-love-you-9-to-5/</guid></item><item><title>纽约市又发送了 11,000 封临时住所纳税信函，向因未检查 2025 年纳税申报表而被错误瞄准的 1,200 人致歉</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/new-york-city-more-pied-a-terre-tax-letters-2025-returns/</link><description>纽约市市长 Zohran Mamdani 在发出 17,000 封警告信之前承认该市缺乏 2025 年税务数据。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2290193702-e1787935294649.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 18:14:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/new-york-city-more-pied-a-terre-tax-letters-2025-returns/</guid></item><item><title>“就像在麦当劳一样”：美国缉毒局调查发现，体育护士向运动员出售阿片类药物，比如“你必须为你的汉堡付钱”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/sports-nurse-drugs-opiods-athletes-dea/</link><description>琼·鲁宾格 (Joan Rubinger) 的客户名单包括数百名运动员，但美国缉毒局发现她发放了数千张非法处方药。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2186872045-e1787944049115.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 19:30:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/sports-nurse-drugs-opiods-athletes-dea/</guid></item><item><title>“我们有工作要做”：美联储主席沃什建议在高通胀的情况下未来几个月加息</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/federal-reserve-chair-kevin-warsh-raising-interest-rate/</link><description>沃什表示，最近有关通胀下降的报告并没有告诉他“基本趋势已经显着改善”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2288203975_add812-e1787942339560.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 19:30:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/federal-reserve-chair-kevin-warsh-raising-interest-rate/</guid></item><item><title>耐克带回了一位 32 年的老将来拯救这个 $60B 的品牌。两年后，其扭亏为盈仍然是一个“漫长而艰难的过程”</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/nike-ceo-veteran-elliott-hill-turnaround-growth/</link><description>首席执行官埃利奥特·希尔已开始整顿耐克的业务。赢回失去的消费者和文化声誉可能要困难得多。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2260535597.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 07:05:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/nike-ceo-veteran-elliott-hill-turnaround-growth/</guid></item><item><title>尽管每天工作 12 小时，亿万富翁 Panda Express 联合首席执行官表示，他从未感到精疲力尽：“这就是生活”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/panda-express-cofounder-andrew-cherng-work-life-balance-hard-work-created-seven-billion-dollar-asian-american-chain-career-success/</link><description>Panda Express 亿万富翁安德鲁·程 (Andrew Cherng) 表示，努力工作（而非工作与生活的平衡）帮助他和妻子建立了价值 70 亿美元的橙子鸡帝国。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2184883632-e1787928259210.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 14:59:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/panda-express-cofounder-andrew-cherng-work-life-balance-hard-work-created-seven-billion-dollar-asian-american-chain-career-success/</guid></item><item><title>被解雇的星条旗工作人员起诉五角大楼，声称对报道航空母舰恶化情况进行报复</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/pentagon-fires-stars-and-stripes-first-amendment/</link><description>《星条旗》出版商马克斯·莱德勒、主编埃里克·斯拉文和中东记者拉拉·科特被列为联邦诉讼的原告。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1252459464.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 17:52:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/pentagon-fires-stars-and-stripes-first-amendment/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普正式签署行政命令，指示政府将安大略湖更名为“美国湖”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/trump-lake-ontario-lake-america-canada/</link><description>特朗普在椭圆形办公室的坚决办公桌前签署了该命令，他坐在一张地图前，上面写着：“让五大湖变得更伟大。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26237644643230-e1787923306457.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 17:49:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/trump-lake-ontario-lake-america-canada/</guid></item></channel></rss>